GlassboxHooks.mid_forward in src/lfm3lab/glassbox.py adapts the operation order
of Lfm3DecoderLayer.forward from modeling_lfm3.py at:
https://huggingface.co/LiquidAI/LFM3-1.7B/blob/40ebe0aa6662c9d40389c2f5d565b6a2c6aebacd/modeling_lfm3.py

Upstream notice: Copyright 2026 The HuggingFace Team. All rights reserved.
