The adaptation intervenes on the actual midpoint residual, adds capture/scoping,
and restores the block's forward implementation on exit. It retains the pinned
sandwich-normalization and residual-addition order. The complete upstream model
implementation is not vendored.

Model weights and tokenizer artifacts are not distributed. The model repository
has separate LFM Open License v1.0 terms, including a commercial-use threshold.
The library license grants no rights to those artifacts or model trademarks.

PyTorch, Transformers and Hugging Face Hub are external dependencies, not
vendored source. The full Jacobian-lens fitter and its referenced implementation
are not included; only the original sync and unembed helpers are retained.
